# Code owners for CI and its credential wiring.
#
# @F1R3FLY-io/ci-maintainers must retain at least `push` on this repository:
# GitHub silently ignores code owners without write access, so a team demoted to
# read would leave these paths effectively unowned with no error anywhere.
#
# This file only auto-requests reviewers on its own. The teeth come from the
# `require_code_owner_review` rule on the devProtect and masterProtect rulesets.

/.github/workflows/  @F1R3FLY-io/ci-maintainers
/.github/scripts/    @F1R3FLY-io/ci-maintainers
/.github/CODEOWNERS  @F1R3FLY-io/ci-maintainers
/deny.toml          @F1R3FLY-io/ci-maintainers
/supply-chain/      @F1R3FLY-io/ci-maintainers
